add(233,57,[291,292,294],[(57,'370–448')],'idea of the earlier run','p-divisible','Oda4.9 separates the p-divisible Albanese contribution from finite p-torsion defects; that distinction helps interpret, but does not solve, the relative deformation questions here.','No finite connected group scheme is recovered from an abstract geometric Tate module alone.','agrees','D06 limits the comparison to the relevant absolute invariants.',[s57(37,'kept','The later result is an absolute comparison with different objects, not a proof of relative flatness.')])
